*OpenGroup: HPAdvanced/Ajustes Avanzados

*OpenUI *HPDensity/Densidad de Tinta: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPDensity
*DefaultHPDensity: Normal
*HPDensity Economy/Raster reducido: "<</cupsReal0 0.80>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity Light/Raster ligero: "<</cupsReal0 0.90>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity Normal/Raster estandar: "<</cupsReal0 1.00>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity High/Raster saturado: "<</cupsReal0 1.10>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity VeryHigh/Raster intensificado: "<</cupsReal0 1.20>>setpagedevice"
*HPDensity MaxTransfer/Raster maximo: "<</cupsReal0 1.30>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *HPDensity

*OpenUI *HPDryTime/Tiempo de Secado: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPDryTime
*DefaultHPDryTime: None
*HPDryTime None/Desactivado 0 seg: "<</cupsInteger7 0>>setpagedevice"
*HPDryTime Short/Corto 5 seg: "<</cupsInteger7 5>>setpagedevice"
*HPDryTime Medium/Medio 10 seg: "<</cupsInteger7 10>>setpagedevice"
*HPDryTime Long/Extendido 20 seg: "<</cupsInteger7 20>>setpagedevice"
*HPDryTime Maximum/Fotografico 40 seg: "<</cupsInteger7 40>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *HPDryTime

*OpenUI *HPPureBlack/Negro Puro: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPPureBlack
*DefaultHPPureBlack: Standard
*HPPureBlack Standard/Estandar Mezcla CMYK: ""
*HPPureBlack TextOnly/Solo Texto GT51 Puro: ""
*HPPureBlack AggressiveK/Separacion K con UCR: ""
*CloseUI: *HPPureBlack

*OpenUI *HPTACLimit/Limite Cobertura TAC: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPTACLimit
*DefaultHPTACLimit: None
*HPTACLimit None/Sin Limite 300%: ""
*HPTACLimit TAC240/240% Papel Comun 75g: ""
*HPTACLimit TAC280/280% Presentacion Mate: ""
*HPTACLimit TAC300/300% Fotografico: ""
*CloseUI: *HPTACLimit

*OpenUI *HPGammaCurve/Curva Tonal y Sombras: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPGammaCurve
*DefaultHPGammaCurve: Standard
*HPGammaCurve Standard/Estandar sRGB: ""
*HPGammaCurve ShadowBoost/Recuperacion de Sombras: ""
*HPGammaCurve HighContrast/Alto Contraste S-Curve: ""
*HPGammaCurve VividLandscape/Paisajes Vivos: ""
*CloseUI: *HPGammaCurve

*OpenUI *HPWatermark/Marca de Agua RIP: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPWatermark
*DefaultHPWatermark: None
*HPWatermark None/Ninguna: ""
*HPWatermark Draft/BORRADOR: ""
*HPWatermark Confidential/CONFIDENCIAL: ""
*HPWatermark Copy/COPIA: ""
*HPWatermark Sample/MUESTRA: ""
*CloseUI: *HPWatermark

*OpenUI *HPInkSaver/Tecnologia InkSaver: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPInkSaver
*DefaultHPInkSaver: Off
*HPInkSaver Off/Off (0%): ""
*HPInkSaver Eco15/Eco15 (15% - Ahorro Minimo): ""
*HPInkSaver Eco25/Eco25 (25% - Ahorro Ligero): ""
*HPInkSaver Eco35/Eco35 (35% - Ahorro Equilibrado Recomendado): ""
*HPInkSaver Eco50/Eco50 (50% - Ahorro Economico): ""
*HPInkSaver Eco65/Eco65 (65% - Ahorro Alto): ""
*HPInkSaver Eco75/Eco75 (75% - Ahorro Maximo Borrador): ""
*HPInkSaver EdgePreserve/EdgePreserve (Preservar Bordes): ""
*HPInkSaver DotGainGrid/DotGainGrid (Micro-Perforacion Dot Gain): ""
*CloseUI: *HPInkSaver

*OpenUI *HPEcoColorDrop/Filtro Ecologico de Color: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *HPEcoColorDrop
*DefaultHPEcoColorDrop: None
*HPEcoColorDrop None/Conservar Todo el Color: ""
*HPEcoColorDrop DropColorBg/Atenuar Fondos de Color: ""
*HPEcoColorDrop EcoGrayscale/Escala de Grises Ecologica: ""
*CloseUI: *HPEcoColorDrop

*CloseGroup: HPAdvanced

